# Smart Search & Predictive Route Engine (Phase 2 & Phase 3)

This plan outlines the next major steps for the UPBUS project: Real-Time Route Prediction (Phase 2) and the User-Facing Smart Journey Search App (Phase 3).

## Goal Description

Since the live API does not provide route names, we need the backend AI to dynamically predict the route a bus is on while it is moving, rather than waiting 12 hours for the trip to complete. Once routes are predicted in real-time, the User App (`web-app`) will allow passengers to search for journeys (e.g. Saharanpur to Gangoh via Khera Afgan). The system will use Graph Search to find the physical path, and match it against live buses.

## Proposed Changes

